-stems is set to yes. The type attribute","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indicates whether this is the start or stop of a slash notation style. The use-dots attribute works as for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"beat-repeat element, and only has effect if use-stems is no.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"}}}